# ==============================================================
# OCEAN PUZZLE - INSTRUCTIONS: ROOMS 1 & 2
# ==============================================================
# Script type : interact
# Bind to     : [FILL IN: x y z of the clickable head block]
# Map/area    : [FILL IN: map name / room]
# Import      : /s i i <paste URL>, then click the head block
#
# What it does:
#   The Oracle explains the note block / symbol matching puzzle,
#   the heart cost of wrong answers, and that dying resets the
#   song. Ends with a grey out-of-character note for co-op
#   players that each player's answer is different.
#   Can be replayed once every 45 seconds per player.
#
# Requires: puzzle1 namespace (see Submit script header)
#
# Related scripts: Instructions Rooms 3 and 4 (share the same cooldown)
# ==============================================================
@using puzzle1
@define Long now = system::currentTimeMillis()

@if oracle_ready_at > now
    @define Long seconds = (oracle_ready_at - now + 999L) / 1000L
    @player &cOracle: You must wait {{seconds}} seconds to hear the instructions again.
    @return
@fi

@var oracle_ready_at = now + 45000L

@player &3Oracle: &bLong ago, the elders sealed their song within these walls. Only one who hears it may pass.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bTen voices lie silent in this chamber. Ten signs keep watch among the drowned stones.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bWake a sign, and it will remember its note for you.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bTeach each silent voice the note its sign remembers.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bWhen the ten sing as one, offer the song to the monument.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bIt will count the voices that stray. Watch closely: the true will glimmer, the false will smoulder.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bThe elders forgive four false offerings. Never a fifth.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bIf the deep takes you, the song is rewritten, and all you learned sinks with you.
@delay 4s
@player &3Oracle: &bListen, seeker. The deep keeps its counsel.
@delay 4s
@player &7&o[Note] Playing co-op? Each player is given their own song. To share one, every teammate must right-click the conduit and type the same team word within 2 minutes. Joining a team starts the puzzle over for the whole team.
